    schema:title "Development Director" ;
    schema:url <https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/crytek/development-director-frankfurt-19259> .

<https://openknowledgegraphs.com/prototypes/kg-jobs/live/job/arbeitnow-devops-cloud-engineer-konstanz-berlin-oder-remote-329511> a prov:Entity,
