    schema:url <https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/jobs/companies/precoro-inc/remote-founding-account-executive-uk-100-outbound-london-415369> .

<https://openknowledgegraphs.com/prototypes/kg-jobs/live/job/arbeitnow-remote-product-engineer-26924> a prov:Entity,
