    schema:title "Werkstudent:in - Grafikdesign E-Commerce (m/w/d)" ;
    schema:url <https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/niboline-gmbh/werkstudentin-grafikdesign-e-commerce-berlin-466687> .

<https://openknowledgegraphs.com/prototypes/kg-jobs/live/job/arbeitnow-werkstudentin-human-resources-recruiting-munchen-389015> a prov:Entity,
