    schema:datePosted "2026-08-02"^^xsd:date ;
    schema:description "Company Description Are you an agile & result-driven person looking for opportunities in a multicultural, secure & fast-paced work environment? AUTODOC is a multicultural tech-company active in 27 countries and with ~5000 people from over 50 nations where things are going fast forward. We are currently in a transformative phase and looking for innovative, tech-driven and agile people to join us. We are striving to create an environment where people are safe and supported - whether it’s in an office space or work-at-home. Would this fit you, or do you know someone who would fit this description then please contact us now and our team will get back to you as soon as possible. Job Description Responsibilities include, but are not limited to: - Search for the synonyms for categories and vehicles for Google and other search engine - Search for the most important product features based on key search queries (distinction criteria for all product categories) - Analysis of the results of renaming the categories and added synonyms - Search for new categories and parents to increase traffic - Proposal for optimizing product cards, linking and category branches - Proposal for the distribution of keywords on the pages, the proper use of categories and their synonyms - Adding category / generic synonyms and product subtitle information to AWS. - Logging of category / generic name changes in Jira, Confluence, Google Sheets. - Mentor and review the work of lower-level professionals. - Work with semantics and search intent (Latent Semantic Optimization (LSO)). - Automate work using Regular Expression, ready-made scripts, and Google Sheets formulas, making graphs etc. What do we offer? Requirements to qualifications: At least 3 years of experience in SEO Extensive experience in semantic optimization: clustering of keywords, searching long-tail queries, LSI Strong time management skills, prioritization of tasks, meeting deadlines Experience with website optimization tools (Ahrefs, Similarweb, KWT, Serpstat, Semrush, GWT, Google Analytics, KeyCollector, etc.) Experience of working with foreign markets Knowledge of HTML / CSS Strong interpersonal skills English – Pre-Intermediate+ Building Effective Teams (Beginner), Building Relationships (Intermediate), Collaboration (Beginner), Data Analysis (Intermediate), Effective Communication (Intermediate), Empowerment (Beginner), Idea Creation (Intermediate), Inclusion (Intermediate), Initiative (Intermediate), Investigating and Reporting (Intermediate), Knowing My Organization (Intermediate), Multi-tasking and Prioritization (Beginner), Quality Control (Intermediate), Structuring Tasks (Intermediate) What should you bring with you? English (Required)Bachelor degree: Marketing (Required) Join us today and let’s create a success story together! Originally posted on Himalayas" ;
